I call it <em>analysis</em> because it is very close to logical
analysis. There are propositions; we order them with logical operators;
and we reach an inference.

Here is the application on a real chart, first read on AUDCHF daily;
the charts below show the same structure on real 2022 data. First the
higher time frame.

Our ability is limited to the current moment. No one owns his past;
it is already gone. No one owns his future; it is only a sum. One owns
only his current moment.

For example, USD has a red flag, CHF a red flag and JPY a red flag,
while NZD has a green flag. So this time I avoid all buys and only sell,
as the red flags in the laydowns for all markets show.

